    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. u mentioned it's \"tricky\" for darker skin—is that because the symptoms themselves are less distinct, or is it more about the diagnostic tools and common symptom descriptions being based on lighter skin? like, is the \"standard\" presentation actually just the White presentation?",
